flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Validate n]
    B --> C[Generate base primes up to floor(sqrt n)]
    C --> D[Select next contiguous block]
    D --> E[Initialize private uint8_t segment to 1]
    E --> F[For each base prime, mark multiples from max(first multiple, p squared)]
    F --> G[Count unmarked values in block]
    G --> H{More blocks?}
    H -->|Yes| D
    H -->|No| I[Display count and mean elapsed time]
    I --> J([End])
